  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p>CRWNHS identifies priority areas for maintaining biodiversity, ecological functions, ecosystem services, water quality, and water supply over the long term. It is made up of natural heritage features, buffers on these features, and natural heritage areas (i.e. Centres for Biodiversity). The mapped components of the Credit River Watershed Natural Heritage System are contained in the following layers:</p><p>1. Aquatic habitat Waterbodies (2015)<a href='https://geohub.cvc.ca/portal/sharing/rest/content/items/c809bd08131f44619b9909c323878e2a/data?token=zQ5CAjFWK6JgyR4fzHO5yl3Bgzvjy-RF3ifSrLTwgB96mSs9Q2TlNIBuBEQ4jGBozz-T_fNMsWvokkEr_ZkgObEyjcnomaT5hJ5jNKNjaoccwACa74WJyNUR4HMCS7BZqZbl8PrMpTzAOnKlWmQ-AbSp4Ibbxpy4zgwc_ASFRPt12uSg7eXp3g_i37v1CSvGps-J_RbqpCmGsiVZFAZhkzLOerua6cp_c4-2faTX-nU.' rel='nofollow ugc'>&nbsp;</a><a href='https://camaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/cfeb6ed6b3a14d45917aa253990ab2be/data' rel='nofollow ugc'>Click here for Metadata</a></p><p>2. Aquatic habitat Watercourses (2015)&nbsp;<a href='https://camaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/c3a194acdf0b4a04afb3f07c0199b9d9/data' rel='nofollow ugc'>Click here for Metadata</a></p><p>3. Boundary (2015)&nbsp;<a href='https://camaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/fce137c937a9441e8361b8c84b2bace1/data' rel='nofollow ugc'>Click here for Metadata</a></p><p>4. Buffers (2015)<a href='https://geohub.cvc.ca/portal/sharing/rest/content/items/ab59dc0f5a9f418e9d21babb914929c3/data?token=LV7q_xjFRrdEFTWOCwkSdjsiB80JbG4ZggMu4GCxCE0oMDl6_9HvUqsv7laHQ7LCA2Z3ir6PQaaRla_x6CbOyKUOCyf1KDo6dJ2fluzZvunySEMfFUEtuUiUKVprcoGVMLL4oUFLXF_JHgZ_VQ2ls-uwrCmIvFQfQrkM8LI-MKGJRIM4ldwc0o5Tc84iCNA9toFK9nQuQg9v_ivmg_CIVDPG84cz4qUwksLhP35Jk2I.' rel='nofollow ugc'>&nbsp;</a><a href='https://camaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/e18e6d36ff5a4acbb87510f7ed3b9ffe/data' rel='nofollow ugc'>Click here for Metadata</a></p><p>5. Centres for Biodiversity (2015)&nbsp;<a href='https://camaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/2d49f37b72574b9c96d026ae3913b232/data' rel='nofollow ugc'>Click here for Metadata</a></p><p>6. Lake Ontario Shoreline (2015)&nbsp;<a href='https://camaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/bc0e7a17c94a441da665a2a3457bd241/data' rel='nofollow ugc'>Click here for Metadata</a></p><p>7. Valleylands (2015)&nbsp;<a href='https://camaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/f23b75d3777a4a6b9449c1c941968e54/data' rel='nofollow ugc'>Click here for Metadata</a></p><p>8. Significant Wildlife Habitat and Habitat of Endangered and Threatened Species (these are not mapped; text criteria only).</p><p>9. Wetlands (2015)&nbsp;<a href='https://camaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/56fd9315e82843ca9a68276ca869307f/data' rel='nofollow ugc'>Click here for Metadata</a></p><p>10. Woodlands (2015)&nbsp;<a href='https://camaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/328b4ee89317433a90d2f8ce2f880f04/data' rel='nofollow ugc'>Click here for Metadata</a></p><p><a href='https://camaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/dbb3374b087a4221a0b7bb006d31e87a/data' rel='nofollow ugc'>Click here for Shapefile User Guide (2025).</a></p><p><a href='https://cvc.ca/document/credit-river-watershed-natural-heritage-system-final-technical-report/' rel='nofollow ugc'>Click here for CRWNHS Final Technical Report</a></p><p>Please scroll down to view the available layers. Click on the layer(s) you're interested in to download the data.</p><p>NOTE: This dataset cannot be downloaded directly from ArcGIS Online; please use the CVC's Open Data portal to download the data.</p>"
